#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:11
msgid "MPM Solver"
msgstr "MPM 求解器"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:13
msgid ""
"Start with :ref:`newton-using-mpm` for scene construction. These experiments"
" help separate numerical accuracy from constitutive response. They are "
"qualitative examples, not calibrated material models or performance "
"benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"先参照 :ref:`newton-using-mpm` "
"构建场景。以下实验有助于区分数值精度与本构响应。它们是定性示例，并非经过标定的材料模型或性能基准。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:18
msgid "Tune Resolution, Time, Then Convergence"
msgstr "先调整分辨率，再调整时间步长和收敛参数"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:20
msgid "Tune one group at a time in this order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序，每次调整一组参数："

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Voxel and particle resolution.** ``MPMSolverCfg.voxel_size`` controls the "
"background grid. Smaller voxels resolve thinner geometry but increase active"
" cells and memory. ``MPMGridCfg.particles_per_cell`` controls particle "
"density; doubling it along each axis creates about eight times as many "
"particles in 3D. Start coarse, then refine until the measured behavior stops"
" changing."
msgstr ""
"**体素与粒子分辨率。** ``MPMSolverCfg.voxel_size`` "
"控制背景网格。更小的体素能分辨更薄的几何，但会增加活动网格单元数和内存用量。 ``MPMGridCfg.particles_per_cell`` "
"控制粒子密度；三维中各轴的数量都加倍，粒子总数约增加到八倍。先用较粗的分辨率，再逐步细化，直到测得的行为不再变化。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Timestep and substeps.** Each Newton substep uses ``SimulationCfg.dt / "
"NewtonCfg.num_substeps``. Reduce ``dt`` or increase ``num_substeps`` first "
"when contacts tunnel, jitter, or become unstable. Substeps do not change the"
" policy period, which also includes environment decimation."
msgstr ""
"**时间步长与子步数。** 每个 Newton 子步的时长为 ``SimulationCfg.dt / NewtonCfg.num_substeps``"
" 。当接触发生穿透、抖动或不稳定时，先减小 ``dt`` 或增加 ``num_substeps`` "
"。子步数不会改变策略周期；策略周期还取决于环境的控制降采样倍数。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Iterations and tolerance.** ``MPMSolverCfg.max_iterations`` caps the "
"rheology solve; ``tolerance`` permits an earlier exit after convergence. "
"Increase the cap only when the solver reaches it, and lower the tolerance "
"only when tighter convergence improves a physical metric. These settings do "
"not repair an unstable timestep, invalid reset, or incorrect collider."
msgstr ""
"**迭代次数与容差。** ``MPMSolverCfg.max_iterations`` 限制流变求解的迭代次数； ``tolerance`` "
"允许收敛后提前退出。只有求解器达到上限时才提高迭代上限；只有更严格的收敛能改善物理指标时才减小容差。这些设置无法修复不稳定的时间步长、无效重置或错误碰撞体。"

