#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:87
msgid "Design a Useful Parameter Study"
msgstr "设计有效的参数研究"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:89
msgid "Use these practices when designing a comparison:"
msgstr "设计对比实验时，采用以下做法："

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:91
msgid ""
"Change one physical quantity at a time. Use the same generated positions, "
"particle mass, collider, timestep, and camera for every variant."
msgstr "每次只改变一个物理量。各组实验使用相同的生成位置、粒子质量、碰撞体、时间步长和相机。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:93
msgid ""
"Choose values that bracket visibly different regimes. Geometric spacing is "
"usually more informative than small linear increments for stiffness, yield, "
"viscosity, and coupling mass scales."
msgstr "选择能覆盖明显不同响应区间的数值。对于刚度、屈服、黏度和耦合质量尺度，按几何级数取值通常比小幅线性递增更有参考价值。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:96
msgid ""
"Preserve the feature the comparison is meant to explain. If a soft elastic "
"specimen loses its silhouette before rebound can be read, reduce the impact "
"energy or raise the lower end of the stiffness range. Do not shorten a clip "
"merely to hide later breakup."
msgstr "保留对比所要说明的特征。如果软弹性试样在能够观察回弹之前就失去轮廓，应降低冲击能量或提高刚度范围的下限。不要仅为隐藏后续碎裂而缩短录像。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:100
msgid ""
"Use deterministic jitter for constitutive comparisons so lattice alignment "
"does not dominate the motion. Keep the no-jitter case as a separate packing "
"diagnostic."
msgstr "本构对比采用确定性的随机扰动，避免晶格对齐主导运动。将无扰动的情况作为单独的堆积诊断。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:103
msgid ""
"Run until impact, peak deformation, recovery or flow, and the final settled "
"state are all visible. A short clip can make different materials appear "
"identical."
msgstr "运行足够长时间，使冲击、最大变形、恢复或流动，以及最终静止状态都清晰可见。过短的录像可能让不同材料看起来相同。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:106
msgid ""
"Tune numerical resolution and timestep before interpreting material values. "
"Record the voxel size, particles per voxel axis, particle count, physics "
"timestep, substeps, iterations, tolerance, random seed, and code revision."
msgstr ""
"解读材料参数前，先调整数值分辨率与时间步长。记录体素大小、每个体素轴上的粒子数、粒子总数、物理时间步长、子步数、迭代次数、容差、随机种子和代码版本。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:109
msgid ""
"Check a quantitative signal alongside the video when possible: center of "
"mass, runout distance, rebound height, retained volume, or settled height."
msgstr "尽可能在观察录像的同时检查定量信号，例如质心、流动距离、回弹高度、保留体积或静止后的高度。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:112
msgid ""
"``particles_per_cell`` is the number of particles along one voxel axis. A "
"value of ``2`` therefore produces approximately eight particles per filled "
"voxel in 3D, not two. Refining both voxel size and particle density can "
"increase memory and runtime rapidly."
msgstr ""
"``particles_per_cell`` 表示一个体素轴上的粒子数量。因此，三维中取值 ``2`` "
"会在每个填充体素中产生约八个粒子，而非两个。同时细化体素大小和粒子密度，可能使内存用量和运行耗时迅速增加。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:119
msgid "Interpret the Comparisons"
msgstr "解读对比结果"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Elastic response:** Poisson's ratio changes both bulk and shear moduli at "
"fixed Young's modulus. Values close to 0.5 approach incompressibility; this "
"is not an independent sweep of volume stiffness. The recording uses 50 kPa "
"Young's modulus and a gentler drop so the impact produces visible strain "
"without obscuring the comparison through loss of the specimen silhouette."
msgstr ""
"**弹性响应：** 在杨氏模量固定时，泊松比同时改变体积模量与剪切模量。接近 0.5 的值对应近似不可压缩的情况，因此这不是单独扫描体积刚度。录像采用 "
"50 kPa 的杨氏模量和较缓和的落下过程，使冲击产生可见应变，同时避免试样失去轮廓而妨碍比较。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Plastic response:** yielding, hardening, friction, and dilatancy interact."
" Keep the other fields fixed within a preset, not necessarily between "
"presets. A high-friction label is not a water-content model; these sand, "
"snow, and clay labels describe illustrative responses rather than measured "
"materials."
msgstr ""
"**塑性响应：** "
"屈服、硬化、摩擦和剪胀会相互影响。应在同一预设内部保持其他字段不变，而不一定要求不同预设之间也相同。高摩擦标签并不表示含水量模型；这里的沙、雪和黏土标签用于说明响应，并非实测材料。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_mpm.rst:130
msgid ""
"**Nearly rigid MPM:** high stiffness and yield limits suppress intended "
"strain and plastic flow but do not impose rigid-body constraints. Residual "
"shape drift, contact differences, and particle sampling error can remain. "
"Compare silhouettes and mass as well as motion; increase resolution only "
"after checking timestep and convergence. Higher particle density is more "
"expensive than a coarse comparison."
msgstr ""
"**近似刚性的 MPM：** "
"高刚度和高屈服限值能抑制应变与塑性流动，但不会施加刚体约束。仍可能存在形状漂移、接触差异和粒子采样误差。除了运动，还应比较轮廓和质量；检查时间步长和收敛后再提高分辨率。较高的粒子密度比粗分辨率对比更耗资源。"

